OL,3,AWatch live as Last Night of the Proms
OL,4,Abrings curtain down on world's biggest
OL,5,Aclassical music festival
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the finale of the world's biggest
OL,8,Fclassical music festival at the Royal
OL,9,FAlbert Hall in London, watch the Last
OL,10,FNight of the Proms above
OL,12,FPianist Yuja Wang and tenor Nicky
OL,13,FSpence are among performers joining the
OL,14,FBBC Symphony Orchestra and Chorus and
OL,15,FBBC Singers, conducted by Sakari Oramo
OL,16,F- read more about him
OL,18,FElgar's Pomp and Circumstance, Parry's
OL,19,FJerusalem and Sargent's Rule Britannia!
OL,20,Fare among the classic works listed in
OL,21,Ftonight's programme
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
