OL,3,AFrench officials investigate if
OL,4,Amalicious act caused train derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials in northern France are
OL,7,Finvestigating whether the derailment of
OL,8,Fa passenger train on Friday evening was
OL,9,Fthe result of a malicious act.
OL,11,F"At this stage, the leading theory is
OL,12,Fthat a piece of rail was present on one
OL,13,Fof the tracks, potentially causing the
OL,14,Fderailment. The reason for its presence
OL,15,Fis unknown," prosecutor Sebastien
OL,16,FGallois said on Saturday.
OL,18,FLocal media say 186 passengers were on
OL,19,Fboard the train that was operating
OL,20,Fbetween Rouen and Caen in Normandy.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
